factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the private vehicles are banned from entering the bus stand, which matches the article, but the reel_script's line 'தனியார் பஸ்களும் சிக்கலை ஏற்படுத்துவதாக மக்கள் கூறுகின்றனர்' (private buses also cause problems) is not stated in the article; the article says people could not tell how private buses enter, which is a different claim.
  The reel_script says 'போக்குவரத்து போலீசார் ... மற்ற நாட்களில் இவர்கள் வந்து செல்கின்றனர்', dropping the article's point that on other days the traffic police also let the vehicles pass freely (சர்வ சாதாரணமாக வந்து செல்கின்றனர்), so the sentence reads as if the police themselves came and went, making the meaning unclear.
  The reel_script says the fine is imposed on two-wheelers and cars 'அவ்வப்போது' by traffic police, which matches, but the reel_script omits the article's key explanation that the crackdown has relaxed because the police no longer enforce the ban strictly, leaving the cause only partly stated.
  The reel_script's point that 'தடையை இடைவேளையின்றி தொடர்ந்தால் பயணிகளின் பீதி குறையும்' is mapped to 'பயணிகளின் கோரிக்கை' in slides, but the slide line 'மக்கள் இவ்வாறு கூறினர்' is placed as a line of the passengers' demand slide, which mixes the attribution with the demand and is ungrammatical in context.
  The slides_spec 'என்ன பிரச்சனை?' slide line 'போலீசார் தடை உள்ளது ஆனால் கண்டிப்பு குறைந்துள்ளது' is grammatically unclear, and the statement that the ban is enforced by police but crackdown has reduced is only partly accurate to the article's sequence of events.
  The caption adds 'என மக்கள் தெரிவித்துள்ளனர்' to the passenger panic point, attributing it to the public generally, while the article attributes it to the people interviewed (மக்கள் கூறியதாவது), which is a minor attribution difference.
  The reel_script's 'பஸ் டிரைவர்களுக்கே சிக்கல் ஏற்படுகிறது' is faithful, but the article's mention of timing, collection and the 'வெற்றிப்பயணம்' private bus-related pressure that causes private buses to rush is omitted, which is an important cause explaining the situation and is missing from the reel_script.
